Slice #4 is complete. Summary of what was built:

- **`weft-core`**: `scan_annotations(text)` scans for `@implements`/`@verifies` inline markers (any comment syntax) and `@addresses` entries in `+++`-delimited TOML frontmatter (DEC/ADR docs); `TraceState` enum + `trace_state(req, annotations)` implements the Orphaned/Incomplete/Stale/Traced decision table from ADR 0002/0003.
- **`weft check`**: walks the project (excluding `.git`/`target`/`node_modules`), scans every file for trace links, computes each active requirement's Trace State, prints `REQ-NNN: <State>`, and exits non-zero if anything isn't `Traced`.
- 11 new tests (7 in `weft-core/tests/trace.rs`, 4 in `weft/tests/check.rs`) cover the four CLI fixture scenarios plus the unit-level decision table. Full suite (31 tests) is green.

